1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
Every day after school
每天放学后

2
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:02,255
I do homework first
我先做作业

3
00:00:02,257 --> 00:00:03,722
Homework is important
家庭作业很重要

4
00:00:04,097 --> 00:00:06,815
because it helps me learn and get better grades
因为这有助于我学习并获得更好的成绩

5
00:00:06,817 --> 00:00:08,656
I try hard on each question
我努力回答每一个问题

6
00:00:08,657 --> 00:00:09,721
even when it's tough
即使这很艰难

7
00:00:09,856 --> 00:00:10,922
But I don't give up
但我不会放弃

8
00:00:11,096 --> 00:00:13,442
because I know perseverance leads to success
因为我知道坚持不懈会带来成功

9
00:00:13,696 --> 00:00:17,376
Doing homework teaches me a lot and makes me feel satisfied
做作业教会了我很多让我感到满足

10
00:00:17,376 --> 00:00:19,602
because I'm improving constantly
因为我在不断进步

